#: ../../howto/timerfd.rst:5
msgid "timer file descriptor HOWTO"
msgstr "計時器檔案描述器 (timerfd) 指南"

#: ../../howto/timerfd.rst:0
msgid "Release"
msgstr "發佈版本"

#: ../../howto/timerfd.rst:7
